OL,3,GNEWSAEdinburgh's Christmas ice rink
OL,4,Aaxed after almost 30 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FEdinburgh's Christmas ice rink has been
OL,7,Faxed after nearly 30 years, organisers
OL,8,Fhave confirmed.
OL,10,FThe winter attraction, that has been on
OL,11,FGeorge Street in recent years, will not
OL,12,Fbe present during the festive programme
OL,13,Fbetween 14 November and 27 January.
OL,15,FThe ice rink has been a feature of the
OL,16,Fcity centre celebrations over the last
OL,17,Fthree decades. It was once in Princes
OL,18,FStreet Gardens before moving to St
OL,19,FAndrew Square and then George Street.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
