OL,3,GNEWSAEdinburgh's Christmas ice rink
OL,4,Aaxed after almost 30 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FEdinburgh's Christmas said the decision
OL,7,Fwas made during the summer, due to
OL,8,Funcertainty while part of Princes
OL,9,FStreet was still closed due to a fire
OL,10,Fthat tore through the former Debenham's
OL,11,Fdepartment store.
